# L §5.4 example units, copied whole.  "unit X: currency minor m declares a currency and its minor unit";
# money prints with its minor-unit digits (L §5.18): JPY minor 1 has none, 1 500 JPY (grouped, L §2.4).
# "minor(X) reads its minor unit" (as money, L §7.2: minor(PLN) is the step 0.01 PLN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2016-03-01
  start 2015-11-01
  end 2016-10-31

source s "s"

unit hour "godzina"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit JPY: currency minor 1

input y: money JPY
input h: num hour

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2016-01-01
  y = 1500 JPY
  h = 2.5 hour

ask q1: y, h, minor(PLN), minor(JPY)
=== expect
q1: (1 500 JPY, 2.5 hour, 0.01 PLN, 1 JPY)
  cut 2016-03-01
